OL,3,GNEWSAYouth football club pavilion plans
OL,4,Aapproved
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Surrey youth sports club's plan to
OL,7,Ftear down its old facilities and
OL,8,Freplace them with a brand new pavilion
OL,9,Fbuilding has been approved.
OL,11,FMolesey Juniors Football Club has
OL,12,Freceived planning permission to
OL,13,Fdemolish a series of smaller buildings
OL,14,Fand build a single, larger clubhouse in
OL,15,Ftheir place.
OL,17,FThe new building would improve
OL,18,Ffacilities at the volunteer-run
OL,19,FWilderness Sports Ground in East
OL,20,FMolesey, the Local Democracy Reporting
OL,21,FService reported.
OL,23,APub: 19-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
