OL,3,GNEWSAYouth football club pavilion plans
OL,4,Aapproved
OL,5,
OL,6,FAccording to planning documents, the
OL,7,Fdesign aimed to "create a high-quality
OL,8,Fpavilion" that would keep with the
OL,9,Fcharacter of the wilderness and provide
OL,10,Fchanging and clubhouse facilities for
OL,11,Fthe football club.
